orm-cxx provides CMake targets:

    find_package(orm-cxx CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE orm-cxx::orm-cxx)

For reflection without database dependencies in the consuming target:

    find_package(orm-cxx-reflection CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE orm-cxx::reflection)

SQLite is enabled by default. Add the postgresql feature for PostgreSQL.
Disable default features for a core-only build or a PostgreSQL-only build.
